@startuml memory-summary-trigger-flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,Arial"
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #90A4AE
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #EBF5FB
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #78909C
skinparam ArrowColor #78909C
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F9A825

title 心屿 — 长期记忆总结异步触发流程

|#E8F5E9| 业务服务 Java Core |
start
:用户对话 → 写入消息记录;
:轮次计数 +1;

if (未总结轮次 >= summaryTrigger 30?) then (是)
  :构造 SummaryReadyEvent\n{userId, saveId, sceneType, idempotencyKey};
  :检查幂等键\nRedis: memory:summary:idempotency:{key};
  if (已处理?) then (是)
    :跳过，防重复消费;
    stop
  else (否)
    :写入幂等键 TTL=7天;
    :发布到 RocketMQ;
  endif
else (否)
  stop
endif

|#F3E5F5| RocketMQ |
:持久化消息\nSummaryReadyEvent;

|#E3F2FD| memory-service MemorySummaryProcessor |
:消费事件;
:Dubbo Generic Call\n查询 summaryBatchSize=30 轮对话;
:构造 AddMemoryRequest\n{messages, userId, agentId, runId\nprompt: FACT RETRIEVAL PROMPT};

|#FFF8E1| PolarDB Memory API |
:POST /v1/memories asyncMode=true;
:LLM 提取关键事实;
:与已有记忆对比\naddMemory 决策：新增/更新/忽略;
:向量化写入向量数据库;
:返回 AddMemoryResponse {memoryId, facts[]};

|memory-service MemorySummaryProcessor|
if (积累记忆数 >= miniMergeThreshold 5?) then (是)
  :POST /v1/memories/merge\nMEMORY MERGE Prompt 去重;
else (否)
endif

if (profileExtractEnabled = true?) then (是)
  :POST /extractProfile\nUSER PROFILE EXTRACTION PROMPT;
  :新画像与旧画像合并\nPROFILE MERGE PROMPT v1;
else (否)
endif

:标记对话轮次已总结;

|业务服务 Java Core|
:下次 Agent 调用时\n长期记忆与用户画像已更新;
stop

note right
  超时与重试：
  · addMemory 超时 16s → 标记失败
  · 最多重试 3 次，间隔 5s
  · XXL-Job 每 10 分钟扫描兜底
  · 并行度 8 线程
end note

@enduml
